<title>USA: Capital Savings Bancorp completes buy back.</title>
<headline>Capital Savings Bancorp completes buy back.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY, Mo. 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Capital Savings Bancorp Inc said Thursday it has completed the repurchase of about five percent, or 49,179 shares, of its outstanding stock.</p>
<p>The shares were repurchased at an average price of $19.12 a share under a program announced July 19.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
